  "question": {
    "text": "A committee of <math><mn>5</mn></math> persons is to be randomly selected from a group of <math><mn>5</mn></math> men and <math><mn>4</mn></math> women and a chairperson will be randomly selected from the committee. The probability that the committee will have exactly <math><mn>2</mn></math> women and <math><mn>3</mn></math> men and the chairperson will be a man is <math><mi>p,</mi></math> then&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to"
  },
